  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-08-16T18:01:46.626Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi,\nI just connected with very slow internet, and have 2 requests.\n1  While the home world is loading (or any world), I would like to be able open a simple menu to choose a different world, or to connect with friends.\n2.  There are some worlds that I use almost every time.  Why do they still have to load every time? My suggestion is that VRChat caches our  favorite worlds, and only checks if the world has changed and needs to be re-dowloaded.  This could either be manual, with us being able to choose which worlds we cache, or it could happen automatically by seeing which worlds we go to regularly.",
